.TH elfshaker-clone 1  "elfshaker 1.0.0-rc1" "elfshaker Manual"
.SH NAME
elfshaker\-clone \- Clones a remote repository into a new directory
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBelfshaker clone\fR [\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-data\-dir\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIrepository\fR> <\fIdirectory\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Clones a remote repository into a new directory
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-verbose\fR
Enables verbose description of the execution process.
.TP
\fB\-\-data\-dir\fR [default: elfshaker_data]
Set the path to the elfshaker repository.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIrepository\fR>
The URL of the remote repository index (.esi) to clone.
.TP
<\fIdirectory\fR>
The name of a new directory to clone into.
